  "historyNote": "#4175, eff 12-1-86; EXPIRED: 12-1-92 New. #5677, eff 7-29-93; ss by #7013, INTERIM, eff 6-20-99, EXPIRED: 10-18-99 New. #7176, eff 12-23-99; EXPIRED: 12-23-07 New. #9452, eff 4-8-09; ss by #12400, eff 10-4-17",
